WEBVTT

04:30.380 --> 04:32.382
What did Ned Stark want you for?

04:33.591 --> 04:35.677
Buying from a slaver?

04:35.802 --> 04:37.720
Selling to one.

04:37.846 --> 04:39.764
Some poachers I caught on my land.

04:41.558 --> 04:45.270
Under my reign, you won't be punished
for such nonsense.

04:45.395 --> 04:47.230
You can rest assured of that.

04:53.194 --> 04:56.364
(DOGS HOWLING)

04:59.784 --> 05:02.745
(ROOSTER CROWS, HEN CLUCKING)
